---
import Layout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import FamilySummary from '../../components/FamilySummary';



---
<Layout title="Account" description="Family profile preview and app preferences.">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
<header><p class="label text-[#71866c]">ACCOUNT & FAMILY</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-[2.4rem]">The people <em>behind the plan.</em></h1><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Here is how the existing Club family profile fits into your app.</p></header>
<div class="mt-7 rounded-2xl border border-[#d8c9a6] bg-[#fff8e9] px-5 py-4"><strong class="text-sm">Sample family · Preview only</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed">The people shown here are fictional. They are not your account, your purchase history, or saved customer details. Account activation is not part of Phase 1.</p></div>
<FamilySummary client:only="react" />
<section class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-warm-rule bg-white p-6"><h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem]">Cleaning preferences</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-soft">Cleaning progress is stored locally on this device, not linked to the sample family.</p><a href="/app/settings" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#536e4e] underline underline-offset-4">Open existing cleaning settings →</a></section>
<section class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-warm-rule bg-white p-6"><h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem]">Need some help?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-soft">Questions about the calendar or companion? We're here.</p><a href="/support" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#536e4e] underline underline-offset-4">Contact support →</a></section>
</div>
</Layout>